module Core

### Represents wrappers that transparently forward the full API of an entity.
### `Controlling[T]` is the scoped mutable-access abstraction for entity
### values, exposing both read and write operations through the wrapper.
### :typeparam T: The referenced entity type.
protocol Controlling[AnyType T] obeys Accessing[T]
  ### Yields the inner entity as an in-flight `T` reference for read/write access.
  ### Implicitly inserted by the compiler at call sites whose target parameter is
  ### `Controlling[T]` and whose argument is any obeyer of `Controlling[T]`.
  ### :returns: The inner entity as `T` (scoped access shape).
  routine Me.control() -> T
